WEBVTT

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.960
I have feelings for you, Madoka! I love you!

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:13.830
What's wrong, Darling?! Darling?!

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.010
S...Suicide?!

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.030
I saw them, with their bags...
S...Suicide?!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:18.120
S...Suicide?!

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.010
...get on the train that goes to Nunokawa Falls!

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.480
Don't end your life...
Don't end your life so soon, Ayukawa!

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.050
Oh...! Ayukawa!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:12.600
Madoka and Yuusaku!
The Marching Song of Runaway Youths.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.600
Good morning.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.790
Good morning.
Good morning.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.700
M...Madoka!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:58.720
I...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.080
What...? What do you want?
I...

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.480
What...? What do you want?

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:08.420
I have feelings for you, Madoka! I love you!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:21.440
It was... an event that was
beyond my wildest imagination...

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.110
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Yeah! Yeah!

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.650
Year 3, Classroom "A"

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:32.630
K...Kasuga! Have you heard?!
Yuusaku confessed his love for Ayukawa!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.050
He made a "Love Attack" on her!

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:37.410
Huh? Uh-huh!

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:40.840
You've gotta come see!
The whole school is going totally nuts!

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.520
It's like a "Saturday Morning Feature Presentation!"

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:49.270
Oh! Ayukawa! Are those roses from Yuusaku?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.630
Huh...? Hey, Ayukawa,
what's your answer? C'mon!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.520
Knock it off!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:59.560
A-ha! Accepting the roses means...
you must've told him "Okay," right?

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.460
Oh!

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:06.730
It's big! Big! Big!
Guess what Yuusaku did to Ayukawa!

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.470
Confessed his love, and made a "Love Attack" on her, right?!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.890
Yessir... Er... Y...You know... already?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.180
Hey, Hikaru, so what happened?

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.780
Yuusaku can do
whatever he wants to, y'know!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.820
Gee, you don't have to hide your feelings!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.870
Oh, gosh! Stop saying crazy things about me!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.190
It's awful! Hino is such a rat...

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.590
...'cause he was always saying how much he liked Hikaru!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.190
Exactly! His feelings changed just like that!

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:40.170
Ha! That's why I can't stand men!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.730
We've got to take firm action, and make our position clear...

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.570
We can't let the boys treat us as if we're toys or something!

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.060
Right! Right!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:47.450
Oooh, knock it off!
Right! Right!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.050
Oooh, knock it off!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.440
'Cause, 'cause... Me, I've got my Darling!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.400
So I don't care!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.450
Father!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.340
Mother!

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:14.910
I've... I've...

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:21.980
...finally... done it!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:49.910
Despite the chaos at school,
Ayukawa is quiet, as if nothing's happened.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:55.710
C'mon, Ayukawa, so what's the story?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.760
How does it feel,
being proposed to by a freshman?

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:04.040
C'mon! Don't keep it to yourself! You can tell us!

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.760
Did you give him an answer yet?
Hey! Ayukawa!

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.330
How far are you gonna go? Are you gonna kiss?

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:14.830
Have you got a history with
this Yuusaku kid before? Well, Ayukawa?

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:18.310
Stop being such a damned buncha snoops!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.230
Rather than being so snoopy...

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.250
...why don'tcha think more about the ones you love!

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:37.130
I had no idea how Ayukawa was feeling...
at that moment.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.600
"Stop being such a damned buncha snoops!"

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.090
Darling!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.840
Let's go home together!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.540
Uh-huh.
Let's go home together!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.580
I'm so pooped today!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.140
Huh?
I'm so pooped today!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:51.230
I'm so pooped today!

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.700
'Cause, all day today,
I've been bombarded with questions...

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.550
...nothing but questions, by everybody at school!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.440
Concerning Yuusaku?

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:02.720
Yes. Although who Yuusaku chooses to like is none of my business.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.160
But I'm glad it happened.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.150
What?
But I'm glad it happened.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:06.240
But I'm glad it happened.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.470
Now I can just concentrate...

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:11.160
...on being with you, Darling, and only you.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.650
Nobody but me, eh...?

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.810
Just because Yuusaku and I
were childhood chums...

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:20.210
...he's been pestering and bugging me
like some annoying housefly!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.400
Madoka! Wait up!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.950
Let's go home together!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:40.070
Ooooh! Why, that Yuusaku...!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:41.930
Darling, come with me for a sec!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.730
Wh...What?!
Darling, come with me for a sec!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:48.200
Girls are really... never, ever, easy to understand...

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:58.150
Hey! Hey, Darling, come here for a sec!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:22.170
H...Hey! What's wrong, Darling?!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.380
I have no idea! All I want to know is...

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.810
...exactly what Ayukawa is up to...

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:35.630
Madoka is such a comedienne!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:39.640
She was holding Yuusaku's hand and all, oh, I just wonder!

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.290
But then...

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.160
What?!
But then...

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.400
...just maybe...
What?!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:46.530
...just maybe...

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.150
What?!
...just maybe...

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:47.240
...just maybe...

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.320
Well, since we were little, Madoka's always...

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.120
...treated Yuusaku like her little brother, so...

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:57.370
Darling! This could mean
what you think it could mean!

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.010
But, it's a little odd...

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.040
Wh...What is?!
But, it's a little odd...

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.130
But, it's a little odd...

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:08.170
Why would Yuusaku
fall for Madoka all of a sudden?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.640
Hikaru, you didn't do anything to Yuusaku, did you?!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:16.570
Oh, gee, not me! I haven't done a thing.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:20.490
Oh! I wonder... if it had to do with that...

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:28.670
"Oh! How cute!"

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.170
"Hikaru, check out my Judo outfit!"

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.300
"I'm gonna be in a Judo competition!"

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.910
"Really...?"

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.720
"The Judo Club asked me to!"

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:49.300
"My Sempai at the Karate Club
said it's all right...

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.330
"...since I'm only a reserve team-member there."

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.950
"He said that before competing,
everybody should get used to the scene!"

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.110
"That's true. I'm glad for you."

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.640
"I've been given a chance... I'll do my best!"

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.000
"There!"

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:17.250
"Yuusaku, you're the worstest of the worst of the worst!"

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:28.630
Darling, it looks like I've hurt him...

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:33.200
Don't be so down. I'm sure Yuusaku just got confused by what you said.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.560
I hope that's the case...

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:41.070
This is autumn, after all...
when the weather changes easily...

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.400
I thought that it was... the weather that did it to Yuusaku, but it ain't.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.980
He's the MAN!

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.610
Darling, whatcha doing?

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:59.980
I...I'll be right there, okay?

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:01.170
What happened was...

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:04.080
...the dude decided to try something we actually meant to be a joke!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.090
He's the MAN!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:10.540
"Yuusaku, you're the worstest of the worst of the worst!"

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.130
"What's the story here...?"

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.740
"Did you goof up yet again?"

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.770
"You see, you just don't know how to handle girls!"

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.350
"Komatsu, look who's talking."

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:24.750
"Shut up!"
"Komatsu, look who's talking."

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:24.800
"Komatsu, look who's talking."

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.760
"Girls, y'see... You can't always keep on going after them!"

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.580
"We aren't playing tag after all!"

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.960
"Haven't you ever heard the saying, 'If pushing fails, then pull!'"

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.560
"Y'know, I got a great tip on how to get Hikaru to appreciate you more!"

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:43.950
And, so... we told him to launch a "Love Attack" on Ayukawa!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:46.220
Hikaru would then get jealous for sure!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:50.560
We told him that Hikaru might next be going after Yuusaku!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.570
He's the MAN!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.890
Y...You've gotta be kidding!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:56.850
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:02.860
What's he pissed about?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.830
Who knows?
What's he pissed about?

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:15.880
I don't know what kind of a shock it must've been for Yuusaku...

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:19.100
...but in any case,
they're using Ayukawa as a tool!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.330
I can't let it go on!

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.670
Yes?

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:27.650
Kasuga!

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:28.550
Ayukawa, the truth is... Yuusaku...
Kasuga!

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:31.590
Ayukawa, the truth is... Yuusaku...

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.200
Sorry... but could you go home?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:40.930
What?!
Sorry... but could you go home?

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:41.500
Please.
What?!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:42.900
Please.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.330
A...Ayukawa!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:09.510
So, Oniichan, what do you think?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:14.680
Kurumi thinks that Madoka and Yuusaku will become lovers for sure!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:18.620
Cuz! Cuz, Madoka's the type that's like an older sister to everyone!

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.660
For her, a younger boy
would be absolutely perfect!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:27.130
No way! Madoka's doing it because she doesn't want to hurt Yuusaku.

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.250
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.220
Oh, gosh, Manami!
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:30.310
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.960
Lots of loves are born from pity!

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.220
That's not true love, no way!
Lots of loves are born from pity!

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:35.310
Lots of loves are born from pity!

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.160
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.180
Manami, you're such an immature baby!
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:39.270
Right, Oniichan?

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:42.890
Lincoln once said,
"A woman's love begins with pity."

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:43.830
Really?!

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:44.900
What baloney!
Really?!

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.870
What baloney!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:57.880
Hello. Kasuga Residence.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.070
Oh, Darling?!
Hello. Kasuga Residence.

00:13:59.070 --> 00:13:59.160
Hello. Kasuga Residence.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:02.900
Yuusaku ran away from home, after writing a note!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.150
R...Ran away from home?!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.480
I wanted to apologize for the other day...
R...Ran away from home?!

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:06.530
R...Ran away from home?!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.190
so I called... and Mrs. Hino said...

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.700
You've got to calm down, Hikaru!
so I called... and Mrs. Hino said...

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.130
But, Yuusaku wrote...
You've got to calm down, Hikaru!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:11.260
But, Yuusaku wrote...

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:12.700
What did the note say?
But, Yuusaku wrote...

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.060
That he'd lost all confidence in himself...
What did the note say?

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:15.200
That he'd lost all confidence in himself...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:15.630
What?!
That he'd lost all confidence in himself...

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:18.800
He wrote, "I might be a loser for life!"
What?!

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:18.930
He wrote, "I might be a loser for life!"

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:20.490
A loser?!
He wrote, "I might be a loser for life!"

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.840
Darling, what are we to do?!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.780
You've got to calm down!
Darling, what are we to do?!

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:28.860
Darling, what are we to do?!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.670
I know where Yuusaku might be.
Leave this to me!

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:33.770
Trouble!

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:37.810
Trouble! Trouble! Trouble! Trouble!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.740
Trouble...

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.400
Kasuga! Big News! Big News!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.870
Hey, Komatsu, if I talk it'll get too messy...

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.040
...so y...you do the t...talking, man!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.200
Gotcha!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.790
S...Suicide?!
Gotcha!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.350
I saw them, with their bags...

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:54.610
...get on the train that goes to Nunokawa Falls!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.490
The Nunokawa Falls are
a popular spot for suicide, y'know!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:59.040
W...Wait a sec...

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:03.340
Who knows... they might jump over
the Nunokawa Falls to kill themselves!

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.980
Don't tell me that Ayukawa would...

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:08.950
Double suicide!
Don't tell me that Ayukawa would...

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.960
Double suicide! A forced double suicide!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.670
Ayukawa felt so bad for Yuusaku that...

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.850
...she felt obliged to die with him? Is that whatcha wanna say?!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:24.400
Oniichan!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.370
Kasuga!
Oniichan!

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:31.140
Kasuga!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.610
Hey!
Kasuga!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:31.730
Kasuga!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:34.420
Don't feel obliged to commit
double suicide just because...

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:37.450
...you feel bad about Yuusaku getting dumped by Hikaru!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.350
You bozo!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.140
No! Ayukawa wouldn't...!

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:47.800
"Since we were kids,
Madoka's always treated Yuusaku...

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.180
"...like he's her little brother."

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.180
"Lots of loves are born from pity, y'know!"

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:58.410
"He wrote, 'I might be a loser for life!' "

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:00.640
"Ayukawa felt so bad for Yuusaku that..."

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:04.660
"...she might've felt obliged to die with him!"

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:13.110
Er, last train to Nunokawa Falls, leaving from Platform 1.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:14.920
Hey, your ticket!

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:17.890
Er, I'll pay later!
Hey, your ticket!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.880
I...

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.480
...barely made it onto the train...

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:39.500
...the one after the one that
Ayukawa and Yuusaku took.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:50.630
Ayukawa will... No, she wouldn't...

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:52.420
"Sorry... but could you go home?"

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.160
"What?!"
"Sorry... but could you go home?"

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:53.920
"Please."
"What?!"

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.550
"Please."

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.940
Ayukawa...

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.990
You can't die!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.840
Don't... Don't do it, Ayukawa!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.800
Why?!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.680
Ushiko!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.610
Umao!
Ushiko!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:53.700
Ushiko!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.970
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.780
Umao! And, wherefore art thou, Umao?!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.120
It's coming along, Yuu.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:19.170
Thank you! More training, please!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.010
N...Now, wait a second!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.680
Kasuga!

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.810
Just what's the story here?!
Kasuga!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:26.900
Kasuga!

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.470
You'd better have a good explanation!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.370
Sorry, but would you stop interrupting us?

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.670
No way!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.430
Ever since yesterday, I just couldn't...

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:39.620
...help wondering what you've been up to, Ayukawa!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.510
I'm sorry... I'll explain everything later...

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.440
...but, for now,
just calm down and watch us.

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:52.570
Yuu, come on!

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:53.940
Yeah!
Yuu, come on!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:08.410
I have no idea... how I ended up like this...

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:14.190
What a forceful move by
Kuroiwa of Asahi Jr. High!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.790
I wonder if Yuusaku will be okay...

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:28.520
He'll win, I'm sure. Right, Kasuga?

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.650
Y...Yeah...

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:34.680
Ayukawa...

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:42.770
"Yuu became discouraged for some reason."

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:45.000
"He said he wanted to train by getting pounded on by the falls...

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:48.030
"...so I came along too."

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.300
"I understand how it must've felt."

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.140
"Huh...?"
"I understand how it must've felt."

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.070
"For Yuu, that is."
"Huh...?"

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:54.670
"For Yuu, that is."

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:00.980
"Ayukawa..."

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.010
"Huh?"
"Ayukawa..."

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:02.080
"Hikaru was really worried..."
"Huh?"

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:04.080
"Hikaru was really worried..."

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.070
"What?"
"Hikaru was really worried..."

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:05.160
"Hikaru was really worried..."

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:08.170
"About being insensitive and not knowing it."

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:11.220
"I see. Of course!"

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:17.410
"For a girl... when there's a boy
trying his best to say that he likes her...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:19.670
"...it's such a happy feeling."

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.750
"I'm sure that Hikaru doesn't feel bad...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.640
"...when someone like Yuu says it,
so straight from the heart...

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.040
"...that he likes her."

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.030
Eeeek!
"...that he likes her."

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:29.120
"...that he likes her."

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.850
At that moment, I was like...

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.620
...I was like...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:38.670
Asahi Jr. High's Kuroiwa is making a one-sided move on Hino!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.340
Oh! He brings Hino down with a Major Outer Reap!

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.890
Kuroiwa grapples him and takes him to the floor!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:48.180
Hino is in a tight spot, folks!

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.340
What're you doing, Yuusaku?!

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:52.450
Get him! Get him! Get him!

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.280
No! Yuusaku's gonna get beaten!

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.390
Bumble! Go kick his butt with your Karate!

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:02.620
Yuusaku! Get a hold of yourself!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.790
Hikaru, louder!

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:07.020
Yeah, your cheers...

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:09.040
...are what Yuusaku needs the most right now!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.550
Yuusaku! Get a hold of yourself!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:23.510
I don't think he can hear me.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.050
Oh! If he's down for
another 10 seconds, he'll lose!

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:31.090
Yuusaku, lose!
Whoops, I meant "Don't lose!"

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:35.900
This calls for...

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:41.930
Kuroiwa's stiff grapple has Hino in a major predicament!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.110
Hikaru, here! Use this!

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:52.370
Yuusaku, get a hold of yourself!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.450
Your Hikaru is behind you all the way!

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:03.380
Yuusaku! If you get beaten here...

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.180
...then you'll be the same old wimp that...

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:08.550
...you used to be!

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.600
Hikaru!

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.840
Go for it, Yuusaku! C'mon!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:18.810
Hikaru...

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:28.680
Yuusaku! Go for it!

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:32.160
All right! Here I go!

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:37.060
Hikaru! Watch me!

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.160
Score!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.590
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:44.850
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:49.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:53.420
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.420 --> 00:24:01.300
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:10.800
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:18.610
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:27.280
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:36.990
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.990 --> 00:24:45.370
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:49.710
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:54.050
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:58.350
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:02.690
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:07.510
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.920 --> 00:25:15.320
I'm you... and you are me?!

00:25:15.690 --> 00:25:20.440
On my eagerly-anticipated birthday, I've "time-slipped" into the past.

00:25:20.440 --> 00:25:23.810
There, obviously, was another me...

00:25:23.810 --> 00:25:26.650
...who... oh, my... tries to assault Hikaru!

00:25:26.650 --> 00:25:30.830
Next time: "Will My Birthday Come Twice?
Time-Runner Kyosuke."
